#. type: Yaml Front Matter Hash Value: sidebar_label
#, no-wrap
msgid "Gate Cutting to Reduce Circuit Width"
msgstr "La découpe de Gate pour réduire la largeur du Circuit"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"<OpenInLabBanner notebookPath=\"qiskit-"
"addons/cutting/01_gate_cutting_to_reduce_circuit_width.ipynb\" />\n"
msgstr ""
"<OpenInLabBanner notebookPath=\"qiskit-"
"addons/cutting/01_gate_cutting_to_reduce_circuit_width.ipynb\" />\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"In this notebook, we will work through the steps of a [Qiskit "
"pattern](https://quantum.cloud.ibm.com/docs/guides/intro-to-patterns) while "
"using **circuit cutting** to reduce the number of qubits in a circuit.  We "
"will cut gates to enable us to reconstruct the expectation value of a four-"
"qubit circuit using only two-qubit experiments.\n"
msgstr ""
"Dans ce notebook, tu vas parcourir les étapes d'un [patron "
"Qiskit](https://quantum.cloud.ibm.com/docs/guides/intro-to-patterns) en "
"utilisant la **découpe de circuit** pour réduire le nombre de qubits dans un"
" circuit. Tu vas découper des portes pour pouvoir reconstruire la valeur "
"d'espérance d'un circuit à quatre qubits en utilisant uniquement des "
"expériences à deux qubits.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "These are the steps that we will take:\n"
msgstr "Voici les étapes que tu vas suivre :\n"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "**Step 1: Map problem to quantum circuits and operators**:\n"
msgstr ""
"**Étape 1 : Mapper le problème en circuits quantiques et en opérateurs** :\n"

#. type: Bullet: '    - '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "Map the hamiltonian onto a quantum circuit.\n"
msgstr "Mapper le hamiltonien sur un circuit quantique.\n"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "**Step 2: Optimize for target hardware** [_Uses the cutting addon_]:\n"
msgstr ""
"**Étape 2 : Optimiser pour le matériel cible** [_Utilise l'addon de "
"découpe_] :\n"

#. type: Bullet: '    - '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "<font color='#0F62FE'>Cut the circuit and observable.</font>\n"
msgstr "<font color='#0F62FE'>Découper le circuit et l'observable.</font>\n"

#. type: Bullet: '    - '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "Transpile the subexperiments for hardware.\n"
msgstr "Transpiler les sous-expériences pour le matériel.\n"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "**Step 3: Execute on target hardware**:\n"
msgstr "**Étape 3 : Exécuter sur le matériel cible** :\n"

#. type: Bullet: '    - '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "Run the subexperiments obtained in Step 2 using a `Sampler` primitive.\n"
msgstr ""
"Lancer les sous-expériences obtenues à l'Étape 2 avec la primitive "
"`Sampler`.\n"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "**Step 4: Post-process results** [_Uses the cutting addon_]:\n"
msgstr ""
"**Étape 4 : Post-traiter les résultats** [_Utilise l'addon de découpe_] :\n"

#. type: Bullet: '    - '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"<font color='#0F62FE'>Combine the results of Step 3 to reconstruct the "
"expectation value of the observable in question.</font>\n"
msgstr ""
"<font color='#0F62FE'>Combiner les résultats de l'Étape 3 pour reconstruire "
"la valeur d'espérance de l'observable en question.</font>\n"

#. type: Title ##
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "Step 1: Map {#step-1-map}"
msgstr "Étape 1 : Mapper {#step-1-map}"

#. type: Title ###
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "Create a circuit to cut {#create-a-circuit-to-cut}"
msgstr "Créer un circuit à découper {#create-a-circuit-to-cut}"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"![Quantum circuit diagram](/img/qiskit-addons/cutting/01-gate-cutting-to-"
"reduce-circuit-width/output_1.png)\n"
msgstr ""
"![Diagramme de circuit quantique](/img/qiskit-addons/cutting/01-gate-"
"cutting-to-reduce-circuit-width/output_1.png)\n"

#. type: Title ###
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "Specify an observable {#specify-an-observable}"
msgstr "Spécifier un observable {#specify-an-observable}"

#. type: Title ##
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "Step 2: Optimize {#step-2-optimize}"
msgstr "Étape 2 : Optimiser {#step-2-optimize}"

#. type: Title ###
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Separate the circuit and observable according to a specified qubit "
"partitioning {#separate-the-circuit-and-observable-according-to-a-specified-"
"qubit-partitioning}"
msgstr ""
"Séparer le circuit et l'observable selon un partitionnement de qubits "
"spécifié {#separate-the-circuit-and-observable-according-to-a-specified-"
"qubit-partitioning}"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Each label in `partition_labels` corresponds to the `circuit` qubit in the "
"same index. Qubits sharing a common partition label will be grouped "
"together, and non-local gates spanning more than one partition will be "
"cut.\n"
msgstr ""
"Chaque étiquette dans `partition_labels` correspond au qubit du `circuit` au"
" même index. Les qubits partageant une étiquette de partition commune seront"
" regroupés, et les portes non locales couvrant plus d'une partition seront "
"découpées.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"**Note:** The ``observables`` kwarg to `partition_problem` is of type "
"`PauliList`. Observable term coefficients and phases are ignored during "
"decomposition of the problem and execution of the subexperiments. They may "
"be re-applied during reconstruction of the expectation value.\n"
msgstr ""
"**Remarque :** L'argument ``observables`` de `partition_problem` est de type"
" `PauliList`. Les coefficients et les phases des termes d'observable sont "
"ignorés lors de la décomposition du problème et de l'exécution des sous-"
"expériences. Ils peuvent être réappliqués lors de la reconstruction de la "
"valeur d'espérance.\n"

#. type: Title ###
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "Visualize the decomposed problem {#visualize-the-decomposed-problem}"
msgstr "Visualiser le problème décomposé {#visualize-the-decomposed-problem}"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"![Quantum circuit diagram](/img/qiskit-addons/cutting/01-gate-cutting-to-"
"reduce-circuit-width/output_2.png)\n"
msgstr ""
"![Diagramme de circuit quantique](/img/qiskit-addons/cutting/01-gate-"
"cutting-to-reduce-circuit-width/output_2.png)\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"![Quantum circuit diagram](/img/qiskit-addons/cutting/01-gate-cutting-to-"
"reduce-circuit-width/output_3.png)\n"
msgstr ""
"![Diagramme de circuit quantique](/img/qiskit-addons/cutting/01-gate-"
"cutting-to-reduce-circuit-width/output_3.png)\n"

#. type: Title ###
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Calculate the sampling overhead for the chosen cuts {#calculate-the-"
"sampling-overhead-for-the-chosen-cuts}"
msgstr ""
"Calculer le surcoût d'échantillonnage pour les découpes choisies "
"{#calculate-the-sampling-overhead-for-the-chosen-cuts}"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "Here we cut two CNOT gates, resulting in a sampling overhead of $9^2$.\n"
msgstr ""
"Ici tu découpes deux Gates CNOT, ce qui entraîne un surcoût "
"d'échantillonnage de $9^2$.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"For more on the sampling overhead incurred by circuit cutting, refer to the "
"[explanatory material](../explanation/index.rst).\n"
msgstr ""
"Pour en savoir plus sur le surcoût d'échantillonnage engendré par la découpe"
" de circuit, consulte le [matériel explicatif](../explanation/index.rst).\n"

#. type: Title ###
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Generate the subexperiments to run on the backend {#generate-the-"
"subexperiments-to-run-on-the-backend}"
msgstr ""
"Générer les sous-expériences à exécuter sur le Backend {#generate-the-"
"subexperiments-to-run-on-the-backend}"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"`generate_cutting_experiments` accepts `circuits`/`observables` args as "
"dictionaries mapping qubit partition labels to the respective "
"`subcircuit`/`subobservables`.\n"
msgstr ""
"`generate_cutting_experiments` accepte des arguments "
"`circuits`/`observables` sous forme de dictionnaires associant les "
"étiquettes de partition de qubits aux `subcircuit`/`subobservables` "
"respectifs.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"To simulate the expectation value of the full-sized circuit, many "
"subexperiments are generated from the decomposed gates' joint "
"quasiprobability distribution and then executed on one or more backends. The"
" number of samples taken from the distribution is controlled by "
"`num_samples`, and one combined coefficient is given for each unique sample."
" For more information on how the coefficients are calculated, refer to the "
"[explanatory material](../explanation/index.rst).\n"
msgstr ""
"Pour simuler la valeur d'espérance du circuit complet, de nombreuses sous-"
"expériences sont générées à partir de la distribution quasi-probabiliste "
"jointe des portes décomposées, puis exécutées sur un ou plusieurs Backends. "
"Le nombre d'échantillons prélevés sur la distribution est contrôlé par "
"`num_samples`, et un coefficient combiné est donné pour chaque échantillon "
"unique. Pour plus d'informations sur la façon dont les coefficients sont "
"calculés, consulte le [matériel explicatif](../explanation/index.rst).\n"

#. type: Title ###
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "Choose a backend {#choose-a-backend}"
msgstr "Choisir un Backend {#choose-a-backend}"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Here we are using a fake backend, which will result in Qiskit Runtime "
"running in local mode (i.e., on a local simulator).\n"
msgstr ""
"Ici tu utilises un faux Backend, ce qui fera tourner Qiskit Runtime en mode "
"local (c'est-à-dire sur un simulateur local).\n"

#. type: Title ###
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Prepare the subexperiments for the backend {#prepare-the-subexperiments-for-"
"the-backend}"
msgstr ""
"Préparer les sous-expériences pour le Backend {#prepare-the-subexperiments-"
"for-the-backend}"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"We must transpile the circuits with our backend as the target before "
"submitting them to Qiskit Runtime.\n"
msgstr ""
"Tu dois Transpiler les circuits avec ton Backend comme cible avant de les "
"soumettre à Qiskit Runtime.\n"

#. type: Title ##
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "Step 3: Execute {#step-3-execute}"
msgstr "Étape 3 : Exécuter {#step-3-execute}"

#. type: Title ###
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Run the subexperiments using the Qiskit Runtime Sampler primitive {#run-the-"
"subexperiments-using-the-qiskit-runtime-sampler-primitive}"
msgstr ""
"Lancer les sous-expériences avec la primitive Sampler de Qiskit Runtime "
"{#run-the-subexperiments-using-the-qiskit-runtime-sampler-primitive}"

#. type: Title ##
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "Step 4: Post-process {#step-4-post-process}"
msgstr "Étape 4 : Post-traiter {#step-4-post-process}"

#. type: Title ###
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "Reconstruct the expectation value {#reconstruct-the-expectation-value}"
msgstr ""
"Reconstruire la valeur d'espérance {#reconstruct-the-expectation-value}"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Reconstruct expectation values for each observable term and combine them to "
"reconstruct the expectation value for the original observable.\n"
msgstr ""
"Reconstruire les valeurs d'espérance pour chaque terme de l'observable et "
"les combiner pour reconstruire la valeur d'espérance de l'observable "
"d'origine.\n"

#. type: Title ###
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Compare the reconstructed expectation value with the exact expectation value"
" from the original circuit and observable {#compare-the-reconstructed-"
"expectation-value-with-the-exact-expectation-value-from-the-original-"
"circuit-and-observable}"
msgstr ""
"Comparer la valeur d'espérance reconstruite avec la valeur d'espérance "
"exacte issue du circuit et de l'observable d'origine {#compare-the-"
"reconstructed-expectation-value-with-the-exact-expectation-value-from-the-"
"original-circuit-and-observable}"

